+    Each word is tried as written and with one leading space. A form is kept only
+    if it encodes to exactly one token that is neither a special token nor one of
+    `reserved_ids` (the reasoning markers). Returns the sorted unique ids, the kept
+    {form: id}, and a description of every dropped form.
